WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.275
Sixteen thousand four hundred ninety nine MAID deaths in 2024.

00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:08.825
Five point one percent of all Canadian deaths.

00:00:08.825 --> 00:00:10.675
One in twenty.

00:00:10.675 --> 00:00:16.487
The program has killed 76,707 people since legalization.
